{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1487920-what-would-a-lodge","id":1487920,"title":"What would a Lodge...","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-25T11:20:50-07:00","id":1487920,"title":"What would a Lodge...","content":"....tightly allied to the Deceived (from Mummy: The Curse) possibly be like? What totem would they have? What Lodge Merits? Maybe access to Sekhem sorcery Open Rites? What Lodge secrets might such a group have? I\u2019m brainstorming, so any help that can be given IS appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-25T14:38:56-07:00","id":1487940,"title":"","content":"I\u2019d present it as first a Fire-Touched Lodge focused on artistry and that creeps out even other Fire-Touched with their enthusiasm. The connection with the Deceived would be their \u2018secrets\u2019 content.<br /> <br /> The totem is most likely some sort of morbid Muse, a spirit of divinely struck inspiration.<br /> <br /> I wouldn\u2019t give them direct access to \u2018splat powers\u2019 like Ritual Sorcery\u2026 but an affinity with Vessels, especially Relics and among them Seba for the Deceived-connection, sounds cool.<br /> Leaning on to the above, the Sacred Hunt benefit could be something similar to the Kepher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-25T14:41:39-07:00","id":1487943,"title":"","content":"Thanks! Yeah, I\u2019ve been thinking of a dark muse totem, too. It fits the Deceived. Speaking of that, I don\u2019t suppose a temakh could be a Lodge totem?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-25T14:52:03-07:00","id":1487944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1487920-what-would-a-lodge?p=1487943#post1487943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks! Yeah, I\u2019ve been thinking of a dark muse totem, too. It fits the Deceived. Speaking of that, I don\u2019t suppose a temakh could be a Lodge totem?</div> </div> </div> </div>Knee-jerk response is Nope, but there\u2019s probably a way to bend the rules/norms around here somewhere.<br /> <br /> And by \u2018bend\u2019 I mean \u2018the idigam would like to take lessons from you about warping the natural world\u2019, since the Temakhs of the Deceived are 1) lacking in deep connections to the laws of the Shadow that other lodge/Tribal totems have, and 2) spiritually maimed to the point I doubt they can do anything as coherent as being a totem, and 3) a big thematic shtick about them is only being able to scratch at the world through their slaves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-25T15:01:09-07:00","id":1487945,"title":"","content":"Ah, ok. Thanks!<br /> <br /> Hmmmm...maybe the Lodge of Dreams Denied? A Pure Lodge, is think. Maybe they tell outsiders they hunt for ancient fetishes, which, while technically true. is only half their mission. And their totem is a spirit of frustration and hopelessness. A state of mind that would make Deceived very attractive allies for it.<br /> <br /> EDIT, <br /> <br /> Mmm. How does one write \u2018Dreams Lost\u2019 in the First Tongue?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 07-25-2022, 07:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T18:17:55-07:00","id":1488119,"title":"","content":"Maybe give them a relic or two? <i>Not</i> a seba, obviously, but other kinds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}